I go to the city by bus.
I reach that large shop.
I go to the women's section.
There are many clothes there.
I look at cotton clothes.
I see a beautiful blue kurta.
This blue kurta is very good.
I ask a person in the shop the price.
"What is the price of this kurta?" I ask.
"Six hundred rupees," he says.
Six hundred rupees is not a big price.
I take the medium size kurta.
I go to the fitting room.
I put on that blue kurta.
The medium size is exact for me.
I like this kurta very much.
I decide to buy this.
